
NTeX Release 1.2 --- ntb-traf 1.1 --- status: optional

This packages contains the binaries to transform .fig files (created by
xfig) to some other formats like epsf and LaTeX. If you have installed xfig 
you should also install this package if you want to use xfig to create other 
files than .fig files, which can be included in you LaTeX documents.

